# Bundler lockfile: local only. GitHub Pages builds with its own pinned
# github-pages gem set and ignores this, and a Windows-generated lock
# (PLATFORMS x64-mingw-ucrt) cannot be satisfied on their Linux builder.
Gemfile.lock
